'''Cabaret Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained during the [[Final Boss Strikes?! Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.5 Update|Version 2.2.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] lowers attack rate and doubles damage. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Cabaret Cat becomes unlockable in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

