==Trivia==
*Cabaret Cat is inspired by the Japanese singer [[wikipedia:Sachiko Kobayashi|Sachiko Kobayashi]] in the first TVCM of Nyanko Daisensou.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Mega Cat had a [[Cat Combo]] called [[Last Boss (Removed Combo)|Last Boss]].
*Prior to the English version of [[Version 11.1 Update|11.1]], this was a [[:Category:Japanese Exclusive Content|Japanese Exclusive]] unit.
*Mega Cat and Mega Cat EX has the longest recharge time of any Cat in the game, excluding [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]].
*Mega Cat and Mega Cat EX also have the longest standing range of any Special Cat.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]] this Cat is called Singer Cat.
*Cabaret Cat was formerly unlocked by inputting the [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] "ラス－ボス" until the feature was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

